    "markdown": "![Hugging Face's logo](https://huggingface.co/front/assets/huggingface_logo-noborder.svg) Hugging Face⟨1⟩\n  *  Models ⟨2⟩\n  *  Datasets ⟨3⟩\n  *  Spaces ⟨4⟩\n  *  Buckets new⟨5⟩\n  *  Docs ⟨6⟩\n  *  Enterprise ⟨7⟩\n  * Pricing⟨8⟩\n  *     * Website\n      *  Tasks⟨9⟩\n      *  HuggingChat⟨10⟩\n      *  Collections⟨11⟩\n      *  Languages⟨12⟩\n      *  Organizations⟨13⟩\n    * Community\n      *  Blog⟨14⟩\n      *  Posts⟨15⟩\n      *  Daily Papers⟨16⟩\n      *  Hardware⟨17⟩\n      *  Learn⟨18⟩\n      *  Discord⟨19⟩\n      *  Forum⟨20⟩\n      *  GitHub⟨21⟩\n    * Solutions\n      *  Team & Enterprise⟨7⟩\n      *  Hugging Face PRO⟨22⟩\n      *  Enterprise Support⟨23⟩\n      *  Inference Providers⟨24⟩\n      *  Inference Endpoints⟨25⟩\n      *  Storage Buckets⟨5⟩\n  * * * *\n  * Log In⟨26⟩\n  * Sign Up⟨27⟩\n\n\n#   Datasets:⟨3⟩\n* * *\n ![](https://huggingface.co/avatars/5e113555a2afd3c9baa0ce5430198735.svg) ⟨28⟩\nMoriton⟨28⟩\n/\nchinese-southeast-asian-test⟨29⟩\nlike 0\nTasks:  Translation ⟨30⟩\nModalities:  Text ⟨31⟩\nFormats:  csv ⟨32⟩\nLanguages:  Indonesian ⟨33⟩ Thai ⟨34⟩ Khmer ⟨35⟩ + 5\nSize:  10K - 100K ⟨36⟩\nTags:  wmt2026 ⟨37⟩ articles ⟨38⟩ southeast-asian-languages ⟨39⟩ monolingual ⟨40⟩ test-set ⟨41⟩\nLibraries:  Datasets ⟨42⟩ pandas ⟨43⟩ Polars ⟨44⟩ + 1\n Dataset card ⟨29⟩ Data Studio ⟨45⟩ Files Files and versions xet ⟨46⟩ Community 1 ⟨47⟩\n##  Request access to the Chinese-Southeast Asian Monolingual Test Set\nPlease provide your personal or institutional information and intended use. Requests are reviewed manually by the dataset owner.\nBy submitting this request, you agree to use the dataset only for the stated purpose and not to redistribute the files to unauthorized users.\nLog in⟨48⟩ or Sign Up⟨49⟩ to review the conditions and access this dataset content.\n  * Data Summary⟨50⟩\n  * Files⟨51⟩\n  * Schema⟨52⟩\n  * Selection Rule⟨53⟩\n\n\n#   ⟨54⟩ Chinese-Southeast Asian Monolingual Test Set \nThis repository contains a gated monolingual test set for 7 Southeast Asian languages plus a Chinese monolingual test set extracted from unused bilingual-pool target-side text.\nAccess is gated with manual approval. Users must request access on Hugging Face, and the repository owner must approve the request before files can be downloaded.\n##   ⟨50⟩ Data Summary   \n| Data type  | Total sentences  | Details  |  \n| --- | --- | --- |  \n| Monolingual test data  | 16,000  | 2,000 monolingual test sentences for each of 7 Southeast Asian languages, plus 2,000 Chinese sentences.  |  \n##   ⟨51⟩ Files   \n| Language  | Config  | Test rows  | File  |  \n| --- | --- | --- | --- |  \n| Indonesian  | `id-mono-test`  | `2,000`  | `id-mono-test.csv`  |  \n| Thai  | `th-mono-test`  | `2,000`  | `th-mono-test.csv`  |  \n| Khmer  | `km-mono-test`  | `2,000`  | `km-mono-test.csv`  |  \n| Malay  | `ms-mono-test`  | `2,000`  | `ms-mono-test.csv`  |  \n| Vietnamese  | `vi-mono-test`  | `2,000`  | `vi-mono-test.csv`  |  \n| Burmese  | `my-mono-test`  | `2,000`  | `my-mono-test.csv`  |  \n| Lao  | `lo-mono-test`  | `2,000`  | `lo-mono-test.csv`  |  \n| Chinese  | `zh-mono-test`  | `2,000`  | `zh-mono-test.csv`  |  \n##   ⟨52⟩ Schema \n  * `text`\n  * `domain`\n\n\n##   ⟨53⟩ Selection Rule \nEach Southeast Asian language contains 2,000 monolingual test rows selected from the local monolingual pool. These rows are constrained to 50-100 whitespace-delimited tokens. For Vietnamese, 701 rows were generated as 50-100-token excerpts from longer monolingual rows because only 1,299 existing rows satisfied the length constraint directly.\nThe Chinese file contains 2,000 target-side Chinese rows sampled from unused rows in the original bilingual high/low pools. Rows already used in the bilingual train or validation files were excluded before sampling.\nCopy to bucket new \n\nDownloads last month\n    22\nTotal file size: 32 MB\nSystem theme\nCompany\nTOS⟨55⟩ Privacy⟨56⟩ About⟨57⟩ Careers⟨58⟩ ⟨1⟩\nWebsite\nModels⟨2⟩ Datasets⟨3⟩ Spaces⟨4⟩ Pricing⟨8⟩ Docs⟨6⟩\n",
